Docker
    WSL backend 24.04
    pytorch/pytorch:2.9.1-cuda13.0-cudnn9-runtime
    Select 24.04 in Docker>Settings>Resources>WSL integration
Nvidia GPU Drivers inside WSL - should already be installed - check with nvidia-smi
Nvidia container toolkit inside 24.04 WSL
    https://docs.nvidia.com/datacenter/cloud-native/container-toolkit/latest/install-guide.html#with-apt-ubuntu-debian
WSL (local dev env)
    user: arthur
    pass: assistant
Run container in WSL
    docker volume create AP-engine
    docker run --rm -v AP-engine:/app alpine/git clone https://github.com/wjsb316/Project-Arthur-.git /app
    docker run --gpus all -it --rm -v AP-engine:/app pytorch/pytorch:2.9.1-cuda12.8-cudnn9-runtime
Development environment
    docker build -t project-arthur Project-Arthur-
    docker run --name arthur-prime --gpus all -d --rm -p 8000:8000 -v /home/arthur/Project-Arthur-:/app/Project-Arthur- project-arthur /entrypoint.sh